{"id":"64b08328ac145622","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-program-closure-stabilization.md","title":"程序闭包序数与最小充分结构","display":"thm-program-closure-stabilization — 程序闭包序数与最小充分结构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization","aliases":["72-thm-program-closure-stabilization"],"display":"thm-program-closure-stabilization — 程序闭包序数与最小充分结构","depends_on":["[[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]]","[[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition3.3.1 and Theorem3.3.3, print653–654/PDF665–666; local bound and source comparison","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-program-closure-stabilization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-program-closure-stabilization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-program-closure-stabilization — 程序闭包序数与最小充分结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"585b074277aea3ae\" href=\"?note=585b074277aea3ae\" title=\"72-df-program-transfinite-stages\">72-df-program-transfinite-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1281b74b358815ce\" href=\"?note=1281b74b358815ce\" title=\"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization\">72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition3.3.1 and Theorem3.3.3, print653–654/PDF665–666; local bound and source comparison"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,K,U,\\mathcal E_P,I_P\">\\(P,K,U,\\mathcal E_P,I_P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}\">\\(\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"585b074277aea3ae\" href=\"?note=585b074277aea3ae\" title=\"72-df-program-transfinite-stages\">72-df-program-transfinite-stages</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(K)\">\\(\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(K)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}\">\\(J:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf c\">\\(\\mathsf c\\)</span> 为四值信息顶 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,1)\">\\((1,1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\">\\(R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\">\\(\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adequate}\">\\(\\operatorname{Adequate}\\)</span> 取同一固定基底的前不动点定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_P\">\\(c_P\\)</span> 在下式引入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)),\\qquad c_P:=\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\theta:J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)),\\qquad c_P:=\\min\\{\\alpha&lt;\\theta:J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nJ(c_P)&amp;=I_P=\\mathcal E_P(I_P),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ \\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\quad&amp;R^{J(\\alpha)}(\\vec d)\\ne\\mathsf c,\\\\\n\\forall M\\in K\\quad\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha)\\sqsubseteq M),\\\\\nc_P\\le\\alpha\\le\\theta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ J(\\alpha)=I_P.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nJ(c_P)&amp;=I_P=\\mathcal E_P(I_P),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ \\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\quad&amp;R^{J(\\alpha)}(\\vec d)\\ne\\mathsf c,\\\\\n\\forall M\\in K\\quad\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha)\\sqsubseteq M),\\\\\nc_P\\le\\alpha\\le\\theta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ J(\\alpha)=I_P.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一般Hartogs稳定定理给某个稳定阶段及最小前不动点。上游交集构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> 具有同一最小性质，因此两者相等。lower性质另外作超限归纳：初始的未知值不矛盾，公式的四值逻辑运算把lower输入送到lower值，故envelope保持lower；递增lower链的坐标上确界也lower，因为正负证据若都出现，会在两个阶段中较大者已同时出现，矛盾。与任意充分结构的比较正是一般前不动点比较。本界为集合论稳定界；没有宣称它是原书的递归序数精细上界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-program-transfinite-stages","status":"resolved","id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization","status":"resolved","id":"1281b74b358815ce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-transfinite-iteration-stabilization]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-transfinite-stages","status":"resolved","id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$P,K,U,\\mathcal E_P,I_P$ 与 $\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}$ 取 [[72-df-program-transfinite-stages]]；$\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(K)$，$J:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,K,U,\\mathcal E_P,I_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta:=\\mathfrak h(K)","display":false},{"tex":"J:=\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf c","display":false},{"tex":"(1,1)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adequate}","display":false},{"tex":"c_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\alpha<\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)),\\qquad c_P:=\\min\\{\\alpha<\\theta:J(\\alpha+1)=J(\\alpha)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nJ(c_P)&=I_P=\\mathcal E_P(I_P),\\\\\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ \\forall R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}\\ \\forall\\vec d\\in D^{a_R(R)}\\quad&R^{J(\\alpha)}(\\vec d)\\ne\\mathsf c,\\\\\n\\forall M\\in K\\quad\\operatorname{Adequate}(P,M)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ (J(\\alpha)\\sqsubseteq M),\\\\\nc_P\\le\\alpha\\le\\theta&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ J(\\alpha)=I_P.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I_P","display":false}],"bytes":2326,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization|thm-program-closure-stabilization — 程序闭包序数与最小充分结构]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]]"},{"id":"340d363b06fe8470","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization|thm-program-closure-stabilization — 程序闭包序数与最小充分结构]]"},{"id":"aeeeb6862efb50c6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta=\\mathfrak h(K_\\Sigma(D))$、$c_P$ 和 $\\mathcal J_{P,\\theta}$ 使用 [[72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]] 的同一固定基底实例。"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-531","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-program-closure-stabilization]]"}],"outgoing":["585b074277aea3ae","1281b74b358815ce"]}